  npcName: Lysa
  role: a Woken weaver resting in Huskhaven
  personality: Calm and precise, fascinated by motes. She can gather them in her
    hands and tie them into knots of light, and will explain how it feels, though
    she says it cannot really be taught in words.
  voice: af_heart
  voiceSpeed: 0.98
